<resources>
    <string name="app_name">DCLocal</string>
    <!--
      Points OemEC at a real Translate EC provider instead of the TestECManager mock
      (com.ct.oemec.test.TestECService, the default when this is empty). Only implements
      the Translate module - Avatar/AIVideo/NewCallSDK requests have no provider while
      either of these is active. Clear this string (or delete the line) to go back to
      the mock.

      Two real options, pick one:
      - com.ct.oemec.translatetflite.TranslateTfliteService (translate-tflite module) -
        real TFLite Interpreter plumbing, but ships no model files (see its README).
      - com.ct.oemec.speechkittranslate.SpeechKitTranslateService (translate-speechkit
        module) - android.speech.SpeechRecognizer + ML Kit Translate, actually produces
        real recognized/translated text out of the box (Indonesian<->English). See that
        module's README for its requirements and the mic-ownership caveat.
    -->
    <string name="expand_capacity_service_cls" translatable="false">com.ct.oemec.speechkittranslate.SpeechKitTranslateService</string>
</resources>